# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository.
#
# This is not housekeeping. Editing this tree from Windows has repeatedly
# produced files with mixed endings, which breaks any tool that anchors on a
# multi-line string — several scripted edits during development failed for
# exactly that reason and had to be redone by hand. Pinning LF in the object
# store means the CI build on Linux and the working copy on Windows are reading
# the same bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
